msgstr "Será que são formações naturais?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "I guess it just grows like that."
msgstr "Acho que cresce assim, do nada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "It's mined... it's all mined!"
msgstr "Toda minerada... e minha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG"
msgid "Who's a proud little seal pup?"
msgstr "Quem é o filhotinho de foca soberbo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT"
msgid "It only comes with a friend-ship."
msgstr "Vem apenas com uma... amizade marinha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "It's so gritty!"
msgstr "Que alegre!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "I could've been skewered!"
msgstr "Eu poderia acabar num espeto!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "That's a CRAZY looking rock!"
msgstr "Que pedra mais MALUCA!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Where did the rest of it go?"
msgstr "Onde foi o resto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "That's burning fast!"
msgstr "Está queimando muito rápido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "Parece bem doente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "Ahm, algo errado não está certo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "Baby trees are so cute!"
msgstr "Árvores bebês são tão fofinhas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "That'll teach him."
msgstr "Assim ele aprende."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "It might be okay if it cooled down."
msgstr "Poderia ficar melhor se tivesse resfriado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "Smells like fresh research."
msgstr "Cheira a pesquisas fresquinhas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "Someone made that strawman eat crow."
msgstr "Alguém fez aquele homem de palha comer alho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Someone MURDERed that scarecrow!"
msgstr "Alguém ASSASSINOU aquele espantalho!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "All dressed up and no where to crow."
msgstr "Todo pintoso e sem nada para espantar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "Spooky."
msgstr "Assustador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Someone else out there likes to scrapbook."
msgstr "Alguém por aí gosta de álbuns de recortes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "The tip of that hat is almost as sharp as... my mind!"
msgstr "A ponta desse chapéu é quase tão afiada quanto... a minha mente!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "Does it make me look more distinguished?"
msgstr "Isso me deixa com um visual mais ilustre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Ready for sculpting."
msgstr "Pronto pra escultura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt right down."
msgstr "Queimou direitinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "We can make stone sculptures with this."
msgstr "Podemos fazer esculturas de pedra com isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "A masterpiece!"
msgstr "Uma obra de arte!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It looks old, but it feels new."
msgstr "Parece velho, mas se sente novo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr "E agora?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Something's moving inside."
msgstr "Alguma coisa está se mexendo lá dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "There's a big piece missing."
msgstr "Tem uma peça grande faltando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "Is that a head?"
msgstr "Essa é a cabeça?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's an odd marble statue."
msgstr "É uma estátua de mármore estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "At least it's back in one piece now."
msgstr "Pelo menos está inteira de novo agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Something's moving inside."
msgstr "Alguma coisa está se mexendo lá dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "I guess he cracked under the pressure."
msgstr "Acho que ele sucumbiu à pressão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Where's the rest of it?"
msgstr "Onde está o resto?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "It's some sort of marble statue."
msgstr "É algum tipo de estátua de mármore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "All patched up."
msgstr "Prontinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Something's moving inside."
msgstr "Alguma coisa está se mexendo lá dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It's not in the best shape."
msgstr "Não está em sua melhor forma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Where did this come from?"
msgstr "De onde veio isso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "The science has been lost to sea."
msgstr "A ciência foi por água abaixo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "I think tanks are in order."
msgstr "Laboratórios de ideias são uma boa ideia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "It's a jumbo seafood gumbo."
msgstr "É um fervido de frutos do mar tamanho família."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "It's a rock."
msgstr "É uma pedra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "Interesting. It's empty."
msgstr "Interessante. Está vazia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "Aren't you the cutest little ball of pure energy?"
msgstr "Quem é essa bolinha fofa de energia pura?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "I was getting tired of carrying loose seeds in my pockets."
msgstr "Eu estava ficando cansado de carregar sementes soltas nos bolsos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Each one is a tiny mystery."
msgstr "Cada um é um pequeno mistério."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "That cooked the life right out of 'em!"
msgstr "Cozidas até a morte!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "That's an entirely scientific mapping tool."
msgstr "Essa é uma ferramenta de mapeamento totalmente científica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
