#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
