msgstr "Utensílios de cozinha ancestrais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
