msgstr "Meu coração está ficando gelado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "The compass has fallen to pieces."
msgstr "A bússola se partiu em pedaços."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP"
msgid "That was a marginally more restful sleep than usual."
msgstr "Isso foi marginalmente mais repousante do que o de costume."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "Er... I can't do that."
msgstr "Ahm... não posso fazer isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "Damp is not dapper."
msgstr "Molhado não é válido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "I hear one of them coming."
msgstr "Estou ouvindo um deles vindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "Say, pal, I don't look so good..."
msgstr "Ei, amigo, não estou muito bem..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "My strength has left me."
msgstr "Fiquei sem força."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "Shame. I was starting to enjoy that."
msgstr "Que pena. Estava começando a gostar disso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "I'm exposed to the elements!"
msgstr "Estou exposto às intempéries!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "I've been left vulnerable!"
msgstr "Eu fiquei vulnerável!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "I'm growing tired."
msgstr "Estou ficando cansado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "My enthusiasm for this has run dry."
msgstr "Meu entusiasmo por isso se esgotou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "That takes care of that."
msgstr "As coisas se ajeitam assim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "It'll be dark soon. Charlie will be waking up."
msgstr "Logo ficará escuro. Charlie vai acordar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "(Gulp!)"
msgstr "(Gulp!)"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "I won't let that anywhere near my mouth."
msgstr "Isso não vai chegar nem perto da minha boca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "Ow! That hurt my mouth!"
msgstr "Oh! Isso machucou minha boca!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED"
msgid "That was putrid."
msgstr "Isso estava pútrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE"
msgid "That was past its expiration date."
msgstr "Já havia passado da validade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY"
msgid "A civilized man does not eat such things."
msgstr "Um homem civilizado não come coisas como essas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING"
msgid "I suppose it's only right to share this with the others."
msgstr "Creio que o correto é dividir isso com os outros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED"
msgid "That hit the spot."
msgstr "Caiu muito bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION"
msgid "I'd rather sleep like the dead."
msgstr "Prefiro dormir como os mortos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED"
msgid "Respect my brawn!"
msgstr "Respeite meu vigor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER"
msgid "That's too stiff a drink."
msgstr "É uma bebida forte demais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.1"
msgid "Reduced... to this..."
msgstr "Reduzido... a isso..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.2"
msgid "Huff... huff..."
msgstr "Ufa... ufa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.3"
msgid "This is... peasant... work..."
msgstr "Esse é... um trabalho de... camponês..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.4"
msgid "Oh... my back..."
msgstr "Oh... minhas costas..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.5"
msgid "I wasn't... built for this..."
msgstr "Não tenho... estrutura para isso..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.6"
msgid "All my joints... are cracking!"
msgstr "Todas as minhas juntas... estão se quebrando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.7"
msgid "I... was a king, you know..!"
msgstr "Eu... era um rei, sabia...!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.8"
msgid "Oof... huff..."
msgstr "Uff... ufa..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENCUMBERED.9"
msgid "This... better not ruin... my suit."
msgstr "Melhor... que isso não estrague... meu traje."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_DOWNGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_UPGRADE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
msgid "That smell... both nostalgic and terrifying!"
msgstr "Esse cheiro... É ao mesmo tempo nostálgico e aterrador!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT"
msgid "Thank goodness for the light."
msgstr "Ainda bem que existe a luz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T1"
msgid "What's this? My shadow puppets feel just a bit stronger..."
msgstr "O que é isso? Minhas marionetes umbrais parecem um pouquinho mais fortes..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T2"
msgid "I can feel the strength of my shadow puppets growing."
msgstr "Consigo sentir a força das minhas marionetes umbrais crescendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T3"
msgid "Go, my shadow puppets! With this power, nothing will stand in our way."
msgstr "Vão, minhas marionetes umbrais! Com esse poder, nada entrará em nosso caminho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EQUIP_SHADOWLEVEL_T4"
msgid "The shadow puppets I summon will be unstoppable!"
msgstr "As marionetes umbrais que eu invocar serão imparáveis!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB"
msgid "Gaah! The horror!"
msgstr "Gaah! Que horror!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE"
msgid "Oh, what a magnificent horror."
msgstr "Ah, que horror magnífico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY"
msgid "It'll be back."
msgstr "Ele vai voltar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK"
msgid "I've been awaiting your return. Let's end this."
msgstr "Estive aguardando o seu retorno. Vamos acabar com isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT"
msgid "There goes my respite."
msgstr "Lá se vai meu descanso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED"
