#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW"
