#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN"
