msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "Color-coded and clearly labeled. Well done!"
msgstr "Organizado por cores e claramente rotulado. Muito bom!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Oh goodness, how lovely!"
msgstr "Oh, céus, que adorável!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "Wrapping presents is soothing work, isn't it?"
msgstr "Embrulhar presentes é um trabalho tranquilizador, não é?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "Reminds me of a story I know."
msgstr "Me lembra uma história que eu conheço."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "If it would sit still long enough, I could classify it."
msgstr "Se ficasse parado por tempo o suficiente, eu poderia classificá-lo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Canis Festivus."
msgstr "Canis Festivus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "I always loved glass sculptures."
msgstr "Sempre adorei esculturas de vidro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "I like to get straight to the point."
msgstr "Eu gosto de ir direto ao ponto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "Careful, it's sharp."
msgstr "Cuidado, é afiada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "A bizarre specimen of the insecta class."
msgstr "Uma espécie bizarra da classe insecta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It appears to be resting."
msgstr "Parece estar descansando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "It's gone gray, but it's still dripping."
msgstr "Ficou cinza, mas ainda está pingando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dripping with goo."
msgstr "Tem uma gosma pingando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "It appears to be quite volatile."
msgstr "Parece ser bem volátil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "The pennons of that strange specimen."
msgstr "As flâmulas daquela espécime estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "A brand new recipe I see. Marvelous!"
msgstr "Uma nova receita, pelo que vejo. Maravilhoso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Serves you right."
msgstr "Você mereceu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "I'm sure it will grow back in time, dear."
msgstr "Tenho certeza de que voltará a crescer com o tempo, meu caro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "His manners have improved considerably."
msgstr "Sua educação melhorou consideravelmente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be a variation of the Monodon monoceros."
msgstr "Parece ser uma variação dos Monodon monoceros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "A gnarwail's \"horn\" is actually a tooth, you know."
msgstr "O \"chifre\" de um gnarvali é na verdade um dente, sabe."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "Tantalizing!"
msgstr "Hipnotizante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I can't imagine these improving visibility."
msgstr "Não posso imaginar como isso melhora a visibilidade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this chops."
msgstr "O mais maleável dos metais, mas vamos ver como isso corta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this mines."
msgstr "O mais maleável dos metais, mas vamos ver como isso mina."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this tills."
msgstr "O mais maleável dos metais, mas vamos ver como isso ara."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how this digs."
msgstr "O mais maleável dos metais, mas vamos ver como isso cava."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "The most malleable of metals, but let's see how it does in the garden."
msgstr "O mais maleável dos metais, mas vamos ver como ele se sai no jardim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "A small lump of gold. Atomic number 79."
msgstr "Uma pedrinha de ouro. Número atômico 79."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "Soft body down! It makes me wish I could sleep."
msgstr "Peninhas macias! Me dá vontade de dormir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "It needs poop."
msgstr "Precisa de cocô."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Combustion!"
msgstr "Combustão!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "Está sofrendo com uma doença agrária que não posso curar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Hm... There are spots of discoloration here."
msgstr "Hm... Tem pontos de descolorante aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A cluster graminoid stalks."
msgstr "Um conjunto de caules graminoides."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "I think it will grow back."
msgstr "Acho que vai crescer de novo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "It can't survive in this hot climate."
msgstr "Não consigo sobreviver nesse clima quente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "It appears docile enough."
msgstr "Parece bastante dócil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It appears to be infected by some unknown pathogen."
msgstr "Parece ter sido infectado por algum tipo de patógeno desconhecido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "I've never encountered this species before. Seems harmless."
msgstr "Nunca encontrei essa espécie antes. Parece inofensiva."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A dainty parasol that will provide moderate protection."
msgstr "Uma sombrinha frágil que dará uma proteção moderada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "The vessel is empty."
msgstr "O recipiente está vazio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It contains a disembodied spirit."
msgstr "Contém um espírito desencarnado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "Oh my, it's a bit rich for me."
msgstr "Minha nossa. É um pouco demais para mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "Works almost as a magical binding agent."
msgstr "Funciona praticamente como um agente colante mágico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Chromium impurities have colored this gem green."
msgstr "As impurezas do crômio deixaram essa pedra preciosa verde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "That should help us keep our bearings."
msgstr "Isso deve nos ajudar a não nos perdermos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It appears to rewind time on an object."
msgstr "Parece fazer o tempo voltar em um objeto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Seems edible, though it may not be totally sane to consume it."
msgstr "Parece comestível, embora talvez não seja totalmente são consumir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Chemistry has altered it."
msgstr "A química o alterou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a fungus."
msgstr "É um fungo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It is dormant this time of day."
msgstr "Está inativo a essa hora do dia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It requires hydration before it can fruit again."
msgstr "Necessita de hidratação para brotar novamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "How interesting, it seems to be forming moon glass stalagmites."
msgstr "Que interessante, parece estar formando estalagmites de vidro lunar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "How interesting, it seems to be forming moon glass stalagmites."
msgstr "Que interessante, parece estar formando estalagmites de vidro lunar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "I always made guacamole for science day at the library."
msgstr "Sempre fiz guacamole para o dia da ciência na biblioteca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "More metabolic byproduct."
msgstr "Mais subproduto metabólico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Knowledge is power!"
msgstr "Conhecimento é poder!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Remember to eat in moderation, children."
msgstr "Lembrem-se de comer com moderação, crianças."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Que amor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "I fear I've a terrible weakness for a spot of chocolate."
msgstr "Temo que tenho uma fraqueza terrível por um pouco de chocolate."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "The candy itself is quite pleasant, if unappealing in appearance."
msgstr "O doce em si é muito agradável, apesar de ter uma aparência pouco atrativa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "There will be some sore jaws in the morning, I imagine."
msgstr "Vamos ver umas mandíbulas doídas pela manhã, imagino eu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "A delightful ten on the Scoville scale."
msgstr "Um lindo dez na escala Scoville."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Delightfully colored kernels of high fructose corn syrup."
msgstr "Pedaços lindamente coloridos de xarope de milho com alto teor de frutose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Hmm, well, at least there's a healthy option on the table."
msgstr "Hmm, bem, pelo menos tem uma opção mais saudável na mesa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "I was always a fan of black licorice, myself."
msgstr "Sempre adorei alcaçuz preto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "It almost seems a shame to eat them."
msgstr "É quase errado comê-los."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "I'd prefer none of you eat these at all."
msgstr "Prefiro que nenhum de vocês coma esses."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "I'll take the ones you don't want, dears."
msgstr "Vou ficar com os que vocês não quiserem, crianças."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "How darling!"
msgstr "Que amor!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "I had best not hear of any tummy aches later."
msgstr "É melhor eu não ouvir que estão com dor de barriga depois."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Bottled valor."
msgstr "Valor engarrafado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "An impressive elixir."
msgstr "Um elixir impressionante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Not as potent as I would have liked."
msgstr "Não é tão potente quanto eu gostaria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "It appears combustible."
msgstr "Parece combustível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "It seems to catalyze a mutation."
msgstr "Parece catalisar uma mutação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "An ornamental poltergeist meant to be hung somewhere."
msgstr "Um poltergeist ornamental para ser pendurado em algum lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "A flourish of flying mammal."
msgstr "O prosperar de um mamífero voador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "An arborator adornment of the arachnid variety."
msgstr "Um adorno de árvore de uma variedade aracnídea."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "I really should decorate."
msgstr "Eu devia mesmo decorar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "An ornament such as this should be hung up."
msgstr "Um ornamento como esse deveria ser pendurado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "A corvus such as this would do better in a tree."
msgstr "Um corvus como esse ficaria melhor numa árvore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "This was perhaps not the most efficient use of resources."
msgstr "Talvez esse não tenha sido o uso mais eficiente dos recursos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "A worker's tool."
msgstr "A ferramenta de um trabalhador."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "That looks much too strenuous."
msgstr "Isso parece muito cansativo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "The woolen fibers of a beefalo's coat make for excellent padding."
msgstr "As fibras de lã do pelo de um bífalo dão um estofamento excelente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "What a fascinating use of kelp."
msgstr "Que uso fascinante para algas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "It gives off a delicate floral aroma."
msgstr "Tem um aroma floral delicado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "This seems ill-suited for a restful night's sleep."
msgstr "Isso parece inadequado para uma noite de bom sono."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "A dare? What childish nonsense."
msgstr "Um desafio? Que bobagem infantil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "I prefer tweed."
msgstr "Prefiro tweed."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "A natural disinfectant."
msgstr "Um desinfetante natural."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "This salve is derived from gastropod secretions."
msgstr "Essa pomada é derivada de secreções de gastrópodes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE"
msgid "It should provide adequate insulation against high temperatures."
msgstr "Deve oferecer proteção contra altas temperaturas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "It is thankless work."
msgstr "Um trabalho ingrato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "It's a bit chilly."
msgstr "Está um pouco fria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Its temperature is below freezing."
msgstr "Sua temperatura está abaixo do ponto de congelamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Its temperature is totally unremarkable."
msgstr "Sua temperatura é totalmente ordinária."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It is warm enough to radiate heat and light!"
msgstr "Está quente o suficiente para irradiar calor e luz!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It is retaining thermal energy. But only a bit."
msgstr "Está retendo energia térmica. Mas só um pouquinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Ah. That would explain the respiration."
msgstr "Ah, isso explicaria a respiração."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "How odd. This rose bush appears to be... breathing."
msgstr "Que estranho. Esse arbusto de rosas parece estar... respirando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "My, she is a bit rude, isn't she?"
msgstr "Nossa, ela é um pouco rude, não é?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES"
msgid "This beverage raises one's body temperature."
msgstr "Esta bebida aumenta a temperatura corporal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE"
msgid "It is a herbal remedy for madness prevention."
msgstr "É um remédio fitoterápico para a prevenção da loucura."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "A stronger brew to cure a particularly severe bout of madness."
msgstr "Uma bebida mais forte para curar um ataque de loucura particularmente grave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "This brew renders lunar entities indifferent to us."
msgstr "Esta preparação deixa as entidades lunares indiferentes a nós."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS"
msgid "A rather calming concoction."
msgstr "Um preparado que tranquiliza bastante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Sometimes a little madness is appropriate."
msgstr "Às vezes, um pouco de loucura é apropriado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "The cooling refreshment is ideal for summer."
msgstr "O refresco é ideal para o verão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED"
msgid "It is a revitalizing brew."
msgstr "É um preparado revitalizante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED"
msgid "The remnants of a lighting apparatus."
msgstr "Os restos de um aparato de iluminação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC"
msgid "It illuminates the space nicely."
msgstr "Ilumina muito bem o espaço."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM"
msgid "Pearl dear, where would you like this?"
msgstr "Pearl, meu bem, onde gostaria que eu colocasse isso?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Oh dear, it's empty. I'll try again later."
msgstr "Oh, céus, está vazio. Vou tentar de novo mais tarde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL"
msgid "This instrument will transport the holder instantly to Pearl's."
msgstr "Este instrumento transportará instantaneamente o portador até a casa da Pearl."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE"
msgid "There is nothing quite like a good cup of tea."
msgstr "Não há nada como uma boa xícara de chá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING"
msgid "I'm happy to support a small business."
msgstr "Fico contente em encorajar uma pequena empresa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT"
msgid "How awful."
msgstr "Que coisa horrível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "I do hope she's in soon."
msgstr "Espero que ela retorne em breve."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "This will do nicely."
msgstr "Isso vai servir perfeitamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "The spring has dried up."
msgstr "A fonte secou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "My old feet could use a good soak."
msgstr "Um mergulhinho faria maravilhas para os meus velhos pés."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR"
msgid "It is a hot spring for soaking underneath that tarp."
msgstr "Debaixo daquela lona, tem uma fonte termal para se mergulhar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "Improving your living space can do wonders for one's mood."
msgstr "Melhorar seu espaço de vida pode fazer maravilhas no humor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Tsk. Look at the state of it..."
msgstr "Tsk. Veja o estado disso..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY"
msgid "Laundry."
msgstr "Lavanderia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT"
msgid "An attractive ornament to be hung on Pearl's house."
msgstr "Um ornamento atraente para ser pendurado na casa da Pearl."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "How very welcome!"
msgstr "Quanta cordialidade!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "How very welcome!"
msgstr "Quanta cordialidade!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "I should tell her."
msgstr "Eu deveria contar a ela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "Oh dear, I do hope I can find him."
msgstr "Puxa vida, espero encontrá-lo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "It's exuding powerful pheromones."
msgstr "Está exsudando feromônios poderosos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "A place to kick up one's feet."
msgstr "Um lugar para colocar os pés para cima."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Not much of an aid now."
msgstr "Não vai auxiliar muito agora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "A navigational aid. \"You are here\"."
msgstr "Um auxílio navegacional. \"Você chegou\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "A chance to give direction."
msgstr "Uma chance de indicar a direção."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sweetened plant nectar."
msgstr "Néctar de planta adocicado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Beeswax used for storing honey."
msgstr "Cera de abelha usada para armazenar mel."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Honey was the only sweetener used for this lovely ham."
msgstr "Mel foi o único adoçante que usei para esse adorável presunto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Bite-sized sweetened meat!"
msgstr "Carne adocicada para petiscar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "What an excellent specimen! I can almost hear the beefalo."
msgstr "Que espécime excelente! Quase posso ouvir o bífalo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "Highly concentrated ectoplasmic residue."
msgstr "Resíduo ectoplásmico altamente concentrado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE"
msgid "This trinket confers a favorable advantage, yet its effect cannot be quantified."
msgstr "Essa bugiganga confere uma vantagem favorável, mas seu efeito não pode ser quantificado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Chili gives me indigestion."
msgstr "Pimenta me dá indigestão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "Yes, I'll definitely soak my feet later."
msgstr "Sim, definitivamente vou mergulhar meus pés depois."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "The spring will replenish itself in good time."
msgstr "A fonte se reabastecerá no devido tempo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "My old feet could use a good soak."
msgstr "Meus velhos pés se dariam bem com uma boa lavada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "I strongly suspect moon glass is organic in composition now."
msgstr "Agora, estou suspeitando fortemente que o vidro lunar seja de composição orgânica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "That hound is not domesticated."
msgstr "Esse cão não foi domesticado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "The endoskeleton of Canis lupus, definitely not familiaris."
msgstr "O endoesqueleto de Canis lupus, definitivamente não familiaris."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "That ought to prevent any more mishaps."
msgstr "Isso deve evitar mais contratempos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It would be in our best interest to dispose of it quickly."
msgstr "Seria do nosso interesse descartá-lo rapidamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Fascinating, it's reanimating before my eyes."
msgstr "Fascinante, está se reanimando diante dos meus olhos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "Those bones are foreboding."
msgstr "Esses ossos são pressagiadores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Made of calcium and brimstone."
msgstr "Feito de cálcio e enxofre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "An improvised dental projectile device."
msgstr "Um dispositivo improvisado para disparar projéteis dentais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "It emits a frequency undetectable to the human ear."
msgstr "Emite uma frequência indetectável ao ouvido humano."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Eons of subterranean evolution went into this widdle malformed monstrosity."
msgstr "Milênios de evolução subterrânea foram necessários para desenvolver essa monstruosidade mau formada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Pygocentrus Nattereri."
msgstr "Pygocentrus Nattereri."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "Mortuus piscis."
msgstr "Piscis mortuus."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "The solid state of water."
msgstr "O estado sólido da água."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "We ought to steer the ships clear of that."
msgstr "Devemos manter os navios longe deles."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "From dangerous solid to harmless liquid. Thank-you, heat."
msgstr "De sólido perigoso a líquido inofensivo. Obrigado, calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "From dangerous solid to harmless liquid. Thank-you, heat."
msgstr "De sólido perigoso a líquido inofensivo. Obrigado, calor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It is a crude heat exchanger."
msgstr "É um trocador de calor rudimentar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Nothing like a book and a bowl of ice cream."
msgstr "Não há nada como um livro e uma tigela de sorvete."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "A perfect cube of ice."
msgstr "Um cubo de gelo perfeito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "What a strange, cold beast."
msgstr "Que fera gelada e estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Perfectly insulated."
msgstr "Perfeitamente isolado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Some kind of ice-throwing contraption."
msgstr "Algum tipo de instrumento arremessador de gelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2"
msgid "A magically-attuned chilling implement."
msgstr "Um instrumento de resfriamento magicamente ajustado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3"
msgid "It gives off a powerful chill."
msgstr "Emana um frio poderoso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It's always prudent to have a set of winter garments."
msgstr "É sempre prudente ter um conjunto de vestimentas de inverno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I must be seeing things."
msgstr "Devo estar vendo coisas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
