msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "I stand on guard for thee!"
msgstr "Fico de guarda para ti!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "I only cry tears of joy."
msgstr "Eu só choro de alegria."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Perfectly roasted."
msgstr "Assado à perfeição."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What do you think Luce, wanna help me chop that? I was only kidding!"
msgstr "O que você acha, Lucy? Quer me ajudar a cortar isso? Só estava brincando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Parecem novas sementes de cultivo pra mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "You're fond of it, aren'tcha Lucy?"
msgstr "Você gosta disso, não é, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Err, moon magic isn't really... my thing... Heh."
msgstr "Ahm, não curto... muito... a magia da lua. Hã."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "This'll make the chores go by quicker!"
msgstr "Assim vai dar para fazer as tarefas mais rápido!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It's shimmering."
msgstr "Está bruxuleando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "Makes the hairs on the back of my neck stand up."
msgstr "Faz os pelos da minha nuca se arrepiarem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "This will help me get around quickly."
msgstr "Isso vai me ajudar a me movimentar mais rápido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "Stay back, greedy rascal."
msgstr "Pra trás, sua malandra gananciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Left nothin' for us."
msgstr "Não sobrou nada pra gente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "What do we have here?"
msgstr "O que temos aqui?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "That's a big leak."
msgstr "É um vazamento dos grandes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "We don't have these up North."
msgstr "Não temos dessas lá no Norte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "It's not done growin' yet."
msgstr "Não terminou de crescer ainda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "It's got some crunch to it."
msgstr "É meio crocante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "It'll grow into a fine tree."
msgstr "Vai virar uma bela árvore."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "What's in the box?!"
msgstr "O que tem na caixa?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Even bread gets sweeter over the holidays!"
msgstr "Até o pão fica mais doce nas festas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "I only sing for Lucy."
msgstr "Canto somente para a Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I'd rather chop than write."
msgstr "Prefiro cortar a escrever."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "Reminds me of the snow-capped mountains back home."
msgstr "Me lembra as montanhas nevadas da minha terra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "That acid'll be a problem, eh?"
msgstr "Esse ácido vai ser problema, hã?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Doesn't matter if you're from the Great White North. Still a bird."
msgstr "Não importa se você é do Grande Norte Branco. Ainda é um pássaro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Finally."
msgstr "Finalmente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I still don't trust it."
msgstr "Ainda não confio nisso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "This is the worst."
msgstr "Isso é terrível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Funny looking vegetable."
msgstr "Vegetal engraçado, esse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "Hoo! That's a hot one, eh?"
msgstr "Hoo! É bem ardida, né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "Pretty tiny but it packs a punch, eh?"
msgstr "Bem pequena, mas é poderosa, né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That looks like a big case of heartburn just waiting to happen."
msgstr "Parece uma azia terrível prestes a acontecer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "I should plant this."
msgstr "É melhor eu plantar isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "More birds! Why is it always birds?"
msgstr "Mais pássaros! Por que pássaros sempre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It had to be birds, didn't it?"
msgstr "Tinham que ser pássaros, não é?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It's all burnt up."
msgstr "Virou cinzas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Could use a touch of green."
msgstr "Um toque de verde cairia bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not giving anything to those birds!"
msgstr "Não vou dar nada pra esses pássaros!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "I call them \"yum pockets\"."
msgstr "Chamo eles de \"bolsos de gostosura\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "I wonder if Lucy would like these."
msgstr "Será que a Lucy iria gostar dessas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Cheira bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "They're frowning at me with little evil faces."
msgstr "Eles estão me reprovando com rostinhos malignos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED"
msgid "Smells nice."
msgstr "Cheira bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "So... senseless."
msgstr "Tão... sem sentido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "I wouldn't want that in my moustache."
msgstr "Eu não iria querer isso no meu bigode."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Look at this phonograph."
msgstr "Olha só esse fonógrafo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "Almost an axe, but not quite."
msgstr "Quase um machado, mas nem tanto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Using a plant to break stone just feels backwards somehow."
msgstr "Usar uma planta para quebrar pedra parece um retrocesso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "It actually looks pretty good."
msgstr "Isso na verdade parece muito bom."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "Looks a little blue."
msgstr "Parece meio baixo astral."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "Too hot-headed if you ask me."
msgstr "Está com a cabeça muito quente se você quer saber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Sure likes that gold."
msgstr "Parece que gosta mesmo desse ouro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Something aboot that guy I like."
msgstr "Tem alguma coisa nesse carinha que eu gosto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "Looks a little blue."
msgstr "Parece meio baixo astral."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "Too hot-headed if you ask me."
msgstr "Está com a cabeça muito quente se você quer saber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Sure likes that gold."
msgstr "Parece que gosta mesmo desse ouro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Something aboot that guy I like."
msgstr "Tem alguma coisa nesse carinha que eu gosto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I don't want to make him mad."
msgstr "Não quero irritá-lo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "Used all the parts of the pig."
msgstr "A gente usa todas as partes do porco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "I'd like to complain to the chef. Politely."
msgstr "Gostaria de falar com o cozinheiro. Educadamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "What a waste of good pork."
msgstr "Que desperdício de uma boa carne de porco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "A mere shell of its former glory."
msgstr "Uma mera casca de sua glória anterior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "It's bacon-stuffed."
msgstr "Está recheado com bacon."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "A little duct tape would fix that right up."
msgstr "Um pouco de silver tape consertaria isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "Sorry! I'm not peeping, I swear!"
msgstr "Desculpe! Não vou fazer um pio, juro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "He's not MY king."
msgstr "Ele não é o MEU rei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "Not a pig anymore."
msgstr "Não é mais um porco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "We're a team! Yah!"
msgstr "Somos uma equipe! É!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Walking back bacon!"
msgstr "Em vias de se tornar bacon!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "That one looks like he means business."
msgstr "Parece que esse está falando sério."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Happens to the best of us."
msgstr "Acontece com os melhores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt."
msgstr "Carbonizado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I think it needs meat, Lucy."
msgstr "Acho que precisa de carne, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Would ya look at that."
msgstr "Mas olhem só pra isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Bacon with a tail."
msgstr "Bacon com rabo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "Looks to be some sort of tent."
msgstr "Parece algum tipo de barraca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "How did they do that without thumbs?"
msgstr "Como eles fizeram isso sem polegares?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "A favour I can cash in some time."
msgstr "Um favor que posso cobrar mais tarde."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "Looks like something those pigs would make."
msgstr "Parece algo que aqueles porcos fariam."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "I should grow it and then chop it down!"
msgstr "Vou cultivar e depois derrubar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Here comes a tree!"
msgstr "Aí vem uma árvore!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "Looks like some kinda pirate flag, eh?"
msgstr "Parece meio como uma bandeira pirata, né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "\"X marks the spot\", eh?"
msgstr "\"X marca o local\", né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "That really isn't my style."
msgstr "Esse realmente não é meu estilo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "That's gross!"
msgstr "Que nojento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking it didn't help much."
msgstr "Cozinhar não ajudou muito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "Looks like some organic headwear."
msgstr "Parece até um chapéu orgânico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what it will be."
msgstr "Qual será?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "A watched plant never grows."
msgstr "Uma planta observada nunca cresce."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Time for grub."
msgstr "Hora da boia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's got no life left, eh?"
msgstr "Não tem mais vida, hã?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "The theater ain't really my sorta thing."
msgstr "Não sou muito chegado em teatro, sabe?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH"
msgid "I think it's about horses or something."
msgstr "Acho que é sobre cavalos ou algo assim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT"
msgid "Not a light read."
msgstr "Não é uma leitura fácil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "I might sleep through it."
msgstr "Vou pensar sobre isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s isn't very polite..."
msgstr "%s não tem muita educação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Knock off the fire starting there, bud."
msgstr "Pare com esses incêndios, ok?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Look who it is! %s!"
msgstr "Olhe só quem é! %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "Someone should rub a heart on %s."
msgstr "Alguém deveria esfregar um coração em %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Enemy of the forest!"
msgstr "Desafeto da floresta!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, you're an alright sort."
msgstr "%s, você é bacana."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC"
msgid "You're not yourself lately."
msgstr "Você não tem sido você mesmo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
msgid "That is throwin' me for a loop, Luce."
msgstr "Tão tentando me enganar, Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD"
msgid "Can't do much with that."
msgstr "Não posso fazer muita coisa com isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER"
msgid "I'll stick to my axe, thanks."
msgstr "Prefiro meu machado, valeu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "É um relógio bem chique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Não parece servir pra muita coisa no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS"
msgid "I'm not too good with this stuff."
msgstr "Não sou bom com essas coisas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "É um relógio bem chique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Não parece servir pra muita coisa no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD"
msgid "I don't know Lucy, that looks like a quick way to a bad time..."
msgstr "Não sei, Lucy. Parece uma maneira rápida de se meter em encrenca..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't know Lucy, that looks like a quick way to a bad time..."
msgstr "Não sei, Lucy. Parece uma maneira rápida de se meter em encrenca..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT"
msgid "Wish she'd put those over somethin' softer to land on."
msgstr "Queria que ela botasse isso sobre algo mais macio pra aterrissagem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "É um relógio bem chique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Não parece servir pra muita coisa no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "É um relógio bem chique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Não parece servir pra muita coisa no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy lookin' clock."
msgstr "É um relógio bem chique."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING"
msgid "Doesn't look like it's doing much right now."
msgstr "Não parece servir pra muita coisa no momento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd hate to be on the receivin' end of that thing."
msgstr "Odiaria ser atingido por essa coisa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "I'm gonna reel in a whopper, no doubt aboot it."
msgstr "Vou puxar um grandão, sem dúvida alguma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "Whoops, I think I got some jam in my beard."
msgstr "Opa, acho que tenho um pouco de geleia na barba."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS"
msgid "Stay away from me, bird!!"
msgstr "Fique longe de mim, pássaro!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT"
msgid "I can't put my finger on it, but there's somethin' aboot it I don't like."
msgstr "Não consigo dizer o que, mas tem algo nisso que não gosto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "That's too fancy for me."
msgstr "Isso é muito elegante para mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "This would go good on flapjacks."
msgstr "Acho que combinaria com panquecas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It weighs a ton!"
msgstr "Pesa uma tonelada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Seedy."
msgstr "Se não mente, fale a verdade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "I can't swim!"
msgstr "Não sei nadar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "This should cook up nicely."
msgstr "Isso deve cozinhar bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Looks like a cod."
msgstr "Parece bacalhau."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "Doesn't look edible."
msgstr "Não parece comestível."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Don't poop in camp!"
msgstr "Sem porcaria no acampamento!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "Chops up food pretty good."
msgstr "Corta a comida muito bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Better settle in, this could take a while."
msgstr "Melhor me aconchegar, isso pode demorar um pouco."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "One meal comin' right up!"
msgstr "A refeição está quase lá!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Well, should we eat?"
msgstr "Bem, vamos comer?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "Nothing sadder than an empty crockpot."
msgstr "Nada mais triste do que uma panela vazia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Sure makes the camp smell nice."
msgstr "Deixa um cheiro bom no acampamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
msgid "Sure, Lucy. We can feed it."
msgstr "Claro, Lucy. A gente pode alimentar ela."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "All ground up."
msgstr "Tudo moído."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not usually one for fancy spices."
msgstr "Não costumo gostar de especiarias sofisticadas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "I always sleep better in a tent."
msgstr "Sempre durmo melhor numa barraca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "A portable tent! Why didn't we think of that, Luce?"
msgstr "Uma barraca portátil! Por que não pensamos nisso, Lucy?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "I love good local produce."
msgstr "Tenho hortaliças locais de qualidade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "Never know when you might need a potato, eh?"
msgstr "Nunca se sabe quando você pode precisar de uma batata, né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "Lucy and I will clean up, since Warly did the cooking."
msgstr "Lucy e eu vamos limpar tudo, já que o Warly cozinhou."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "I'll eat a tater in any form."
msgstr "Como batatinhas de todo jeito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "It cooked up real nice."
msgstr "Ficou muito bem cozidinho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It's as big as a boulder!"
msgstr "Parece uma rocha de tão grande!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Parecem novas sementes de cultivo pra mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "I do love me some plant life."
msgstr "Amo mesmo a vida vegetal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "I like the ones made with real sugar better."
msgstr "Gosto mais dos que são feitos com açúcar de verdade."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "I don't think they're here to say a polite \"hello\"."
msgstr "Não acho que eles tão aqui pra darem \"bom dia\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs more water."
msgstr "Precisa de mais água."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "I just don't like the look of that thing... can't put my finger on it..."
msgstr "Não gosto da aparência desse negócio... não consigo pôr meu dedo nele..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "What a hoser."
msgstr "Que trambiqueiro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Filthy feathered menace."
msgstr "Ameaça plumada imunda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "It's my prisoner."
msgstr "É o meu prisioneiro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Do you think you're cute? You're not."
msgstr "Você se acha fofinho? Você não é."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I don't like to eat things that grow on the ground."
msgstr "Não gosto de coisas que crescem no chão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER"
msgid "Sure you can carve a pumpkin better, Luce. Sure."
msgstr "Claro que você consegue fazer uma abóbora melhor, Lucy. Claro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "This will keep me chopping."
msgstr "Isso vai permitir que eu continue cortando."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "You know why I didn't ask you, Lucy. You would've butchered it."
msgstr "Você sabe por que eu não te pedi, Lucy. Você teria destruído tudo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED"
msgid "This should be fun."
msgstr "Isso vai ser divertido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "I won't say no to some pie."
msgstr "Não vou recusar uma torta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Pies are good."
msgstr "As tortas são boas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "It'd better not tip over."
msgstr "É melhor não virar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'd be happier if it was a giant pumpkin pie."
msgstr "Ficaria mais feliz se fosse uma torta de abóbora gigante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "It's a seed."
msgstr "É uma semente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "I should see how much of a punch I'm packing, eh?"
msgstr "Eu deveria ver como tá minha força, né?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "Makes me feel a bit twitchy."
msgstr "Me deixa meio inquieto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "The sparkle is gone from the gem."
msgstr "O brilho se foi da pedra preciosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "It's nothing a good chopping wouldn't fix."
msgstr "Nada que uma boa lenhada não conserte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "A pretty useful guide in this neck of the woods."
msgstr "Um guia muito útil nessa parte da floresta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "It hasn't finished the food we gave it."
msgstr "Ainda não terminou a comida que eu dei."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "We gotta load it up with good eats."
msgstr "A gente precisa colocar comidas boas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "Can't chop that."
msgstr "Não dá pra cortar isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Pretty enough."
msgstr "Bem bonita."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "That must have taken some time to make."
msgstr "Isso deve ter levado um bom tempo pra fazer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "I'm not huge on art."
msgstr "Não sou muito fã de arte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Sure are a lot of statues around here."
msgstr "Tem muitas estátuas por aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Take it easy, eh?"
msgstr "Vai com calma, hã?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "No more berries."
msgstr "Acabaram as bagas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "That's a fancy way to eat."
msgstr "Esse é um jeito elegante de comer."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Looks like new crop seeds to me."
msgstr "Parecem novas sementes de cultivo pra mim."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "It's good for the oven."
msgstr "É bom para o forno."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "I'll just make something small."
msgstr "Vou fazer alguma coisa pequena."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "This coin could use a polish."
msgstr "Uma polidinha cairia bem nessa moeda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "I'm gonna buy something nice for Lucy."
msgstr "Vou comprar alguma coisa legal pra Lucy."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "Not a Looney but I guess it works around here."
msgstr "Não vale muito, mas acho que deve dar pra comprar alguma coisa aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "Nothin' like being owed a favour."
